<section class="set" id="set">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="center rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">The set</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Every tool you keep<br>searching the web for.</h2>
      <p class="sub">All of them in one place, and new ones every week.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="bento">
      <article class="tile t7 r1 rv">
        <span class="tag">Documents</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Every PDF job, in one place.</h3>
        <p class="body">Merge, split, reorder, compress, redact for real, images to PDF, PDF to images and searchable scans.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/docs.webp" alt="A marble scroll whose end splits into floating sheets" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi pdf"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/></svg></span>Lease.pdf&nbsp; 4.2 MB to <em>880 KB</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tile t5 r1 rv" style="--d:80ms">
        <span class="tag">Images</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Exactly the size the form asks for.</h3>
        <p class="body">Convert, compress, resize to the KB, remove backgrounds, erase objects, upscale 4x and passport photos.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/image.webp" alt="A marble hand holding a polished mirror" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi img"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="1.6"/><path d="m20 15-4-4-8 8"/></svg></span>signature.png&nbsp; 67 KB to <em>43 KB</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tile t5 r2 rv">
        <span class="tag">Sound and video</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Clean sound. Clean cuts.</h3>
        <p class="body">Trim, convert, fit an upload limit, remove noise, even out loudness, extract audio and read aloud.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/sound.webp" alt="A marble lyre with dust hanging in rings around it" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi vid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="13" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"/></svg></span>4.6 GB video trimmed in <em>0.96 s</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tile t7 r2 rv" style="--d:80ms">
        <span class="tag">Everything else</span>
        <h3 class="h3">And everything in between.</h3>
        <p class="body">Zip and unzip, copy text from a picture, clean up a signature, make print sheets, and do math right in the bar.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/convert.webp" alt="A marble amphora separating into rings that become a cube" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi id"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h10"/></svg></span>Text copied from a scan, <em>under 0.2% error</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tile t6 r3 rv">
        <span class="tag">Sharing</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Straight to your phone.</h3>
        <p class="body">Over your own Wi-Fi. No cable, no cloud, no account.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/share.webp" alt="A winged marble sandal in flight" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi vid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12.5a10 10 0 0 1 14 0M8 15.5a6 6 0 0 1 8 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.5" r="1"/></svg></span>Sent to your phone, <em>on your own network</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tile t6 r3 rv" style="--d:80ms">
        <span class="tag">Plugins</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Never finished.</h3>
        <p class="body">Anyone can build a new tool. Each one runs sandboxed and offline.</p>
        <div class="art"><img src="/grain/plugins.webp" alt="A horse head half carved out of raw marble" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1117"></div>
        <div class="res"><span class="fi id"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></span>New tool installed, <em>no network access</em></div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="bento-foot rv">
      <p><b>39 tools today.</b> New ones every week.</p>
      <a class="more" href="https://github.com/anzal1/panoply#what-is-in-it">See every tool</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
